Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:09.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I adore you, Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:10.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is this?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:12.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:16.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They're saying there's an alien\Non this ship! Gives me the chills!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:18.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A-An alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:21.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A Gnosia infectee, to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:23.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Same difference, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuri, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.51,0:00:27.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure. The name's Shigemichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,H-Hi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:33.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on? I've never seen{\i0}\N{\i1}either of these people before.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:36.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Do you remember me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:38.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:40.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.05,0:00:42.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.51,0:00:44.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I... love... you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:47.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,S-Setsu, don't we need to be at the meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:50.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:52.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}EPISODE 3: NEW CREW MEMBERS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:33.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This should be all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:35.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seven of us...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:37.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:44.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know now that looping the same time frame{\i0}\N{\i1}doesn't guarantee the same outcome, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:50.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But that also means you're just beginning\Nyour long journey to escape this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.89,0:02:52.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that's what they meant.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:54.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In other words...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:02:56.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Every time I loop, the conditions change.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:58.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We don't know who the Gnosia is.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:03.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to find and eliminate them,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:06.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}or I'll never be able to escape this loop.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Calm down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:15.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if the conditions have changed,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:17.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}this is my third time going through{\i0}\N{\i1}the meetings and votes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There must be something I can do...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.14,0:03:23.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is it true that there are two Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:28.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes. I am detecting two Gnosia{\i0}\N{\i1}out of the seven here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.05,0:03:30.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.22,0:03:33.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Ah, so that's what you sound like, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:35.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:43.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There are two among us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:47.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There's no need to despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:51.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We already know that one of them\Nis clearly faking their amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.55,0:03:53.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course Racio would latch onto me again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:56.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be too obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:01.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's true that I've lost my memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:07.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but a lot of the blanks have been filled in\Nthanks to the instant learning, Racio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:10.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh? How curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:13.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Seems like you got tired\Nof your previous strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:18.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Very well. Though I'm sure you're even\Nmore suspicious to everyone else now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:20.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- Do you think so?\N- Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:27.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I think that your case for Yuri\Nbeing Gnosia is still a little lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:32.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:34.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I doubt the results will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:37.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Racio hasn't changed at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:39.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because their brain moves way too fast,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:44.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it makes people think that they're trying to{\i0}\N{\i1}lead the meeting in the direction they want.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At this rate, once again,{\i0}\N{\i1}they're going to...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:49.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to change something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:54.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.22,0:04:57.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I-I hate that I'm being suspected,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.97,0:05:03.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but I do believe that Racio's attempts\Nto solve the mystery are genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:09.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Ooh, so you don't, like,\Nthink that Racio is a Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:10.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:16.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Cozying up to me won't save you from\Ncold sleep, you know. Just give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.59,0:05:17.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seriously?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:22.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is all futile. The result won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:25.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The one we'll be sending\Nto cold sleep is none other than...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:31.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How frustrating. How insanely frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:37.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Honestly, now I understand\Nthe pain of a capable ruler
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:40.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,who gets executed by the uneducated masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the end, things didn't change.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:47.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hah! You'll soon have what's coming to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Because of your foolish choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:51.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Okay, get in the fridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:52.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:04.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's red...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:09.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah. Because there's\Nstill at least one Gnosia left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wait. Then are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.09,0:06:16.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We currently don't even know\Nif Racio was a Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.39,0:06:18.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That is correct, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:22.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Even if Racio was a Gnosia,\None still remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:27.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And if Racio was actually human,\Nthen there are still two Gnosia left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Therefore, the light was\Nalways going to be red.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:37.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Which means we cannot know at this point\Nwhether Racio was human or Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.47,0:06:43.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see. Now that there are two Gnosia, it's{\i0}\N{\i1}become that much harder to work things out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:44.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Setsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:45.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:50.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,For all you know, I could be\Na Gnosia myself right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:55.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Never mind. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.51,0:07:04.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right. There's a possibility{\i0}\N{\i1}that Setsu is a Gnosia, as well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.76,0:07:06.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll have to figure this out myself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:11.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:14.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh. Hey, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:16.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:17.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:21.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I gotta have the right environment for\Nthis meal, or it's just not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:22.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:29.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:33.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is my first time eating\Nramen made by an Earthling!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:34.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You should have some, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:36.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Er, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.30,0:07:42.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.22,0:07:45.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If only the AC was a bit stronger here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:47.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, considering your costume...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:50.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Costume? What costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:52.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is my skin. It's artificial skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:57.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I was in an accident, you see.\NThough honestly, this isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:08:00.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now, have a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:02.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.34,0:08:07.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Salt content's at 3.5, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:09.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Better not drink all the broth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:11.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:21.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's so salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:26.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There's extra noodles, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:32.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:35.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Less talking, more walking, bud!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:38.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If you can't hold your liquor,\Nyou shouldn't drink to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:39.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Where's your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:42.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We need to go visit Stella first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:43.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:47.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Man, she's just head over heels for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.43,0:08:49.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be the one to save her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:50.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:54.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,When we were fleeing Liu-An,\NI heard you helped her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:56.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.93,0:09:00.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Man... Why'd you have to get in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:03.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe. I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:04.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:17.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Down we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh? Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:21.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:24.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my little garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:27.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What beautiful flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.34,0:09:31.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm carefully cultivating these little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:32.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:38.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, I can let you know\Nwhen these little ones bloom,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:41.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,so please come back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:42.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:44.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You bet we'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.55,0:09:47.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:50.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Please promise me that you absolutely will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I saved her...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:01.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I adore you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:05.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Beginning warp countdown.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Ten, nine, eight...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:11.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess having no memories...{\i0}\N{\i1}is something you don't really feel.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:24.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unable to sense Setsu's presence.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:26.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That means Setsu was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.47,0:10:29.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Don't look all surprised that\Nsomeone disappeared, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.84,0:10:33.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We already know there's\Nat least one Gnosia left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:37.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gnosia never attack other Gnosia.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.59,0:10:40.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which confirms that Setsu was human.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:45.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But right now, the situation{\i0}\N{\i1}is either this... or this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:49.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we send a human to cold sleep now,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:52.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and there ends up being the same{\i0}\N{\i1}number of humans and Gnosia,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:54.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the Gnosia will win.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.09,0:10:57.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to do something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:11:00.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it all right to begin the meeting?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:03.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I kinda wish we didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:08.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now, what shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:12.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let's lay out what we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:13.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,First off, there's five of us left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.18,0:11:15.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Setsu was human,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:18.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and we don't know which Racio was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:19.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:22.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Uh, what do you mean, "And?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.64,0:11:24.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's got to be something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:26.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You've seen a couple Gnosia now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:29.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was there any kind of hint, or...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:37.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was just a gut feeling, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:40.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Can I talk for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:41.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.84,0:11:45.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Er, I know this sounds weird, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:52.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I just want to confirm\Nsomething with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:55.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Everyone here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:57.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,is human, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:00.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:02.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yup, yup! Cute li'l SQ is human!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:05.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is there really a point in doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:09.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Gnosia are experts at lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:13.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But their original personality\Nremains at the forefront.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:15.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We might be able to tell if they're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:20.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm... Yes, I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:23.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jina...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:26.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What about you, Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:30.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm human. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:33.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:35.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:40.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh? What's with that intense stare?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:44.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna flip-flop from me to Jina?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.51,0:12:47.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No girl likes two-timing jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.76,0:12:49.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jina...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.47,0:12:50.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,is lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.84,0:12:55.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,She's not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:57.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:12:59.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:02.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You can't just say that with no evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.34,0:13:05.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Even if it's you, Yuri, I don't believe\Nit's fair to decide so matter-of-factly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:06.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:09.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.09,0:13:14.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if I know she's lying, there's no{\i0}\N{\i1}point if the others don't vote for her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:19.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, if we're on the subject of suspicious\Npeople, I think Stella's pretty shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:22.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But... That's quite unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:23.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:25.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.97,0:13:31.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's Jina. Jina's the one who's lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.93,0:13:35.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please... Get through to everyone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:37.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the truth!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.59,0:13:41.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jina is absolutely a Gnosia!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:46.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Voting has completed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:49.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Five valid votes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:51.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The voting rate is 100%.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:53.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The votes will now be tallied.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.97,0:13:54.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.97,0:13:57.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.59,0:14:28.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're still here, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:33.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Would you like some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.76,0:14:35.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hey! No way, no way, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.76,0:14:38.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It'll make you feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.76,0:14:43.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,absolutely wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:08.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ENGINEER CREDENTIALS
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.97,0:15:24.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Engineer credentials?{\i0}\N{\i1}What does that even mean?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.47,0:15:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ENGINEER CREDENTIALS
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:30.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So you're saying there are two Gnosia\Nand one Engineer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:34.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, that is correct.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:38.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Gnosia aren't going to out themselves,\Nso we can set them aside for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:39.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but who's the Engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.43,0:15:44.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,U-Um, what is an Engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:47.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Right. I guess your memories\Nare still in disarray.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:52.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Humans who have Engineer credentials\Ncan access the database.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:57.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They can choose one person during each warp
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:16:02.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and determine if that person is human\Nor Gnosia with 100% accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:06.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Being able to pick out Gnosia{\i0}\N{\i1}during the warp...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.39,0:16:10.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What's this? Could our\Nlittle Yuri be the Engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:12.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:14.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why, you ask? Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.30,0:16:17.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I am the Engineer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:24.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,During the next warp, I will choose someone\Nand find out if they are Gnosia or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:25.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:30.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Maybe you. You're the most suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:34.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,W-Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:39.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh? Looks like something's about to go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.26,0:16:41.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Engineer...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:43.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.34,0:16:47.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oho, how interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:49.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But now, you've definitely\Ndug your own grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:53.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You've basically just revealed\Nthat you're a liar and a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:55.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You just laid it all out on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:56.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course they'd say that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:17:00.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only one person can have{\i0}\N{\i1}Engineer credentials.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.22,0:17:05.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means... that either{\i0}\N{\i1}Racio or I must be lying.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.39,0:17:09.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That also applies to you, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:12.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh? So you're saying that I'm a liar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:15.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If only LeVi could tell us\Nwhich is the real one...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:20.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unfortunately, I can only determine{\i0}\N{\i1}the number of credentials issued.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.22,0:17:23.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Jina?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.34,0:17:29.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I don't know either Yuri\Nor Racio very well, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:31.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:35.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Especially because this is the first time\NI'm hearing Yuri's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.43,0:17:39.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess she doesn't have{\i0}\N{\i1}feelings for me in this loop.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:41.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Shigemichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.26,0:17:44.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me? Don't worry, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.05,0:17:48.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I believe that you're the real Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:49.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:52.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yup. And my gut is never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.14,0:17:55.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:59.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's already been determined\Nthat either Yuri or I is lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:04.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Therefore, all you need to do is bombard us\Nwith questions to find out who the liar is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.55,0:18:06.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay, they fell for it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:10.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When someone isn't sure{\i0}\N{\i1}who's acting suspicious,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:14.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they become wary of anyone who tries{\i0}\N{\i1}to take control of the situation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:19.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Especially if it's someone smart, like Racio.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:24.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Bombarding you guys with\Nquestions sounds like a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:26.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why don't we settle it with\Nrock-paper-scissors instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.97,0:18:27.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.97,0:18:31.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's definitely an option.\NLeave it up to God, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.43,0:18:35.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- Uh, wait, no...\N- No. I really don't like that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:38.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:41.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We will now change over{\i0}\N{\i1}to the voting process.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.51,0:18:44.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's down to either Racio or me,{\i0}\N{\i1}no question about it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:46.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.14,0:18:48.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Considering how all the other{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.47,0:18:50.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- voting results ended up,{\i0}\N{\i1}- The voting result will{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- be deemed to be the will of all present,{\i0}\N{\i1}- I should have a chance at winning.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:54.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and you will abide by it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.93,0:18:56.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you agree?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:18:59.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll just have to believe.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:03.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then it is time for the verdict.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:05.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is the Gnosia?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.51,0:19:19.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Voting has completed. Seven valid votes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:21.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The voting rate is 100%.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:24.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The votes will now be tallied.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:34.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It has been decided.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.55,0:19:38.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Racio will be put into cold sleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:46.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So I can only investigate one person per day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.09,0:19:48.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Affirmative.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:51.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And because of the extra load on the{\i0}\N{\i1}system due to anti-Gnosia measures,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:53.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the investigation will take some time{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.97,0:19:56.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and the result will be provided{\i0}\N{\i1}to you after the warp.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.43,0:20:02.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So if the Engineer wishes to investigate\Nfive people, it'll take them five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.26,0:20:05.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It doesn't take any great leap of logic
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.34,0:20:10.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,to conclude that anyone claiming Engineer\Nwill be a priority target for the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:12.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is an interesting implement.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.51,0:20:18.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's graphite mixed with clay.\NApparently it's known as a "pencil."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:20.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I found it in the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't waste this ability I was given.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:25.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to investigate someone suspicious,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.05,0:20:29.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}determine they're Gnosia,{\i0}\N{\i1}and convince everyone else{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.43,0:20:31.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}before I get eliminated.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:37.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As long as I know I'm the Engineer,{\i0}\N{\i1}I also know Racio must be lying.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:40.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means that Racio is{\i0}\N{\i1}confirmed to be a Gnosia.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.76,0:20:45.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That also means that it's very likely that{\i0}\N{\i1}whoever was supporting Racio is a Gnosia.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:47.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That leaves five suspects.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:49.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There has to be something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:52.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Surely I have enough information{\i0}\N{\i1}to form some kind of lead.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.93,0:20:55.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,LeVi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.05,0:20:57.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How can I help you?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.09,0:21:00.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.55,0:21:11.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You know who the Gnosia is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.01,0:21:13.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:17.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes. I used my Engineer credentials\Nto investigate...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.39,0:21:19.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Shigemichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.89,0:21:23.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The result was... Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.43,0:21:24.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:27.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Shigemichi is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.09,0:21:31.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,W-Wait. Of course, I can't deny\Nthat that's a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.84,0:21:34.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But Yuri could also be lying\Nabout being the Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:36.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Racio could've been the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:38.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,True!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:41.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't panic. Stay calm and continue.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.89,0:21:44.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that you'll get through to everyone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:49.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I have no way of proving that\NI'm actually the Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:54.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But even if we set that aside,\Nthere's a contradiction in your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:57.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:21:58.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.51,0:22:00.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I looked at the voting\Nresults from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:04.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Shigemichi, you voted for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.97,0:22:08.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Even though you argued\Nwith Racio at the meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.30,0:22:11.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,you and Racio both voted for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:16.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That probably means you planned the\Nwhole thing out beforehand. As Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:20.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Racio faked being the Engineer\Nand said they would investigate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.26,0:22:24.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That was to try to put suspicion on me,\Ndriving me into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.43,0:22:28.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But they failed and ended up frozen instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.34,0:22:29.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.05,0:22:32.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That makes, like, a lot of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:35.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,B-But... If that's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.14,0:22:38.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,wouldn't it be weird for me not to\Neliminate Yuri during the warp?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.89,0:22:42.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'd obviously predict that they'd come\Ninvestigate me as the Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:45.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes. And that's probably why you hesitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.51,0:22:49.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Last night, I imagine you looked\Ninto who everyone voted for as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.43,0:22:53.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And yesterday, Jina voted for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.26,0:22:56.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The fact that she was on to you scared you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.51,0:22:58.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and that's why you decided\Nto eliminate Jina.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.55,0:23:04.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Because you believed that I still hadn't\Nrealized you were the Gnosia yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.84,0:23:10.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You guys can talk about whatever\Nyou want in the remaining time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.59,0:23:12.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:15.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm going to vote for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.22,0:23:21.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's see who's going to the fridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.18,0:23:29.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shigemichi and Racio...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.43,0:23:33.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those two have to have been the Gnosia.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.34,0:23:36.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.89,0:23:40.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.72,0:23:48.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Gnosia presence has been eliminated.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.22,0:23:51.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It appears that we have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.97,0:23:56.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Let's celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.22,0:23:58.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.55,0:24:00.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We did it. We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.22,0:24:02.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.43,0:24:06.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We did it! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.34,0:24:07.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.30,0:24:30.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.30,0:24:34.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But we eliminated all of the Gnosia!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.47,0:24:37.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We survived!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.89,0:24:45.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet, I still had to go back?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.30,0:24:50.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.64,0:24:57.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Go and be frozen, Yuri.

